  "body": "## [0.2.1] - 2026-10-04\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- Add configuration validation\r\n- Add descriptive configuration validation errors\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Handle prediction errors gracefully and adjust sky track elevation threshold\r\n\r\n### ⚡ Performance\r\n\r\n- *(timeline)* Cache satellite pass times in timeline state\r\n\r\n### 🚜 Refactor\r\n\r\n- Simplify group handling and improve diagnostics\r\n- *(config)* Validate configuration after loading\r\n- *(config)* Clarify configuration error naming\r\n- *(config)* Model group identifiers as an enum\r\n- *(group)* Use anyhow Result for error handling\r\n- *(timeline)* Rename HOURS_WINDOW to WINDOW_HOURS and use f64\r\n\r\n### 🎨 Styling\r\n\r\n- *(config)* Suppress clippy enum variant names lint for ConfigError\r\n\r\n### 🧪 Testing\r\n\r\n- *(config)* Verify default configuration is valid"
}
